Enclosed is  the index to hpjet.tar, a complete
collection of hplaserjet stuff avialable during off hours from
anonymous ftp to ionvax.tn.cornell.edu (128.84.253.20)
or               tcgould.tn.cornell.edu (128.84.253.35)(/pub)
