index:
 
 This directory contains the following:

Readme 			this file
ditroff/		ditroff filters from net.sources
filter/			some output filters       
hpsh/			a shell script print jobber
laser/			Ron Flax's laser.c source (print jobber)
misc/			A LLITOUT toggler & some other stuff
nroff/			nroff filters from net.sources
tbl/			a program for setting up printcap?, from net
tex/			dvi2lj+ archive
troff/			troff filters from net


 These files were assembled with the help of Jim Lowe
 (james@unix.macc.wisc.edu) 

 As of Oct 6 1986 Ron Flax's laser.c is the only thing I have run 
 successfully.- Very nice - (on uvaxII, dhv11, Ultrix1.2, plain laserjet)
 I haven't had the need to get the others going so that is not
 a criticism, its just not an endorsement.
 
